    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class collects all the defs and uses associated with each node in the traversed <ref refid="classssa__private_1_1CFG" kindref="compound">CFG</ref>. Note that this does not compute reachability information; it just records each instance of a variable used or defined. </para>    </detaileddescription>
